Securing Cloud Infrastructure (AWS)
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Deploy secure AWS infrastructure using Terraform with security best practices
Configure IAM roles and policies programmatically using Python and AWS CLI
Perform security assessments on AWS infrastructure using automated tools
Implement defense-in-depth security strategies for cloud environments
Analyze and remediate common cloud security vulnerabilities
Prerequisites
Basic understanding of AWS services (EC2, VPC, IAM, S3)
Familiarity with Linux command line operations
Basic knowledge of Python programming
Understanding of infrastructure as code concepts
